  profileLabel: Progression Endgame Motivation
  survivalNeed: This area tests whether the player can survive bad visibility, pressure,
    and long return distance.
  survivalNeedWeight: 1.1
  resourceNeed: The water should promise expensive late-game value, not casual farm
    loops.
  resourceNeedWeight: 1.15
  engineeringNeed: Better gear, stronger tools, and prior preparation should matter
    here.
  engineeringNeedWeight: 1.2
  curiosityPull: Abyss edges, strange silhouettes, and severe gradients should keep
    pulling attention deeper.
  curiosityPullWeight: 1.45
  storyPull: 'This is where strong narrative pull should live: mystery, consequence,
    and deep-world answers.'
  storyPullWeight: 1.6
  rareValuePull: The strongest lure here is rare value worth fear, planning, and
    a later return.
  rareValuePullWeight: 1.75
  optionalityRule: These pulls are invitations, not requirements; the player decides
    which one matters today.
  returnRule: The area should stay worth revisiting later with a different goal,
    toolset, or tolerance for risk.
  ownershipRule: The player should feel they built their own reasons to come back
    here.
